#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:57
msgid ""
"This package includes the RTI Connext core DDS libraries only; it does not "
"include the full Connext Professional suite of tools and run-time services. "
"Note that these Connext libraries are automatically installed when "
"installing ``rmw_connextdds`` using apt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Other Installation Options** The `Connext Robotics Toolkit <https://www."
"rti.com/developers/connext-robotics-toolkit>`__ includes the full suite of "
"Connext tools and infrastructure services. It provides a single step "
"installation of ROS and Connext using apt. It is free for prototype "
"development, research, non-commercial and academic use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:65
msgid ""
"Detailed instructions for building and tuning the RMW and ROS 2 applications "
"for a variety of platforms, and enabling DDS Security are available on the "
"`RTI ROS Community <https://community.rti.com/ros>`__ pages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:69
msgid "Install rmw_connextdds binary packages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:71
msgid ""
"To install the binary packages for ``rmw_connextdds`` and the Connext "
"libraries from the ROS 2 apt repositories, use the following command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:73
msgid "$ sudo apt update && sudo apt install -q -y ros-rolling-rmw-connextdds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:79
msgid "Building rmw_connextdds from source code"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:81
msgid ""
"Building from source code can ensure the RMW is matched to your system and "
"installed correctly. The following instructions assume a Linux x86_64 build "
"host and target; the `RTI ROS Community <https://community.rti.com/ros>`__ "
"pages have instructions for building for other platforms and targets, "
"including Arm, Windows, and macOS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:85
msgid ""
"Clone the repository for ``rmw_connextdds`` into your ROS 2 workspace and "
"select the branch that matches the ROS 2 distribution in use:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:87
msgid ""
"$ mkdir -p ros2_ws/src\n"
"$ cd ros2_ws\n"
"$ git clone -b rolling https://github.com/ros2/rmw_connextdds src/"
"rmw_connextdds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:93
msgid "Then, install necessary packages for RTI Connext DDS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:95
msgid ""
"$ cd ..\n"
"$ rosdep install --from src -i"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:100
msgid ""
"Set up the environment to help colcon discover where RTI Connext is "
"installed. This can be done by manually setting the environment variable "
"``NDDSHOME`` to the location of the RTI Connext installation, or by using a "
"script that comes with the RTI Connext installation. For example, for "
"version 7.7.0, you can run the following code to execute the helper script:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:104
msgid ""
"$ source /opt/rti.com/rti_connext_dds-7.7.0/resource/scripts/"
"rtisetenv_x64Linux4gcc8.5.0.bash"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:108
msgid ""
"If the previous command failed, and you can't find the location of the RTI "
"Connext installation, run this to find all Connext installations (and their "
"corresponding helper scripts) in your system:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:110
msgid "$ find /opt -name rtisetenv*.bash"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:116
msgid ""
"Replace ``.bash`` with your shell if you're not using bash. Possible values "
"are: ``rtisetenv*.bash``, ``rtisetenv*.sh``, ``rtisetenv*.zsh``, "
"``rtisetenv*.tcsh``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:119
msgid "Make sure you have the ROS 2 environment set up:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:121
msgid "$ source /opt/ros/rolling/setup.bash"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:125
msgid "Build the RMW using colcon:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:127
msgid "$ colcon build --symlink-install"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:131
msgid ""
"After the build completes successfully, be sure to source the setup file for "
"the workspace:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:133
msgid "$ source install/setup.bash"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:139
msgid "Use the resulting rmw_connextdds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:141
msgid ""
"Set the environment variable ``RMW_IMPLEMENTATION`` to tell ROS 2 which RMW "
"to use:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-RTI-Connext-DDS.rst:143
msgid "$ export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_connextdds"
msgstr ""

